//// The `jhonstart-html` package — module-tree root.
////
//// The `html """…"""` markup DSL (`html.bp`), cut out of the jhonstart core by
//// front 95: a consumer that drives the builder API directly never compiles
//// the comptime front-end. The expansion lowers to the core's builders and
//// resolves every tag in the CALLER's scope, so a consumer writes
//// `import {html} from "jhonstart-html";` beside
//// `import {div, p, text} from "jhonstart";`.

pub mod html;
